[
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00001",
    "bgm": "056"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "灯織に聞きたいことがあってさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002011110010,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……？　はい\r\nなんでしょうか",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charCategory": "stand_fix",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "002",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200201111/2002011110010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "幽霊役について\r\n色々あったけど、結局詳しく聞かずにきたから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "監督がめちゃくちゃ怖い時あったろ\r\nあの１時間強制休憩の日",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002011110020,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ああ……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201111/2002011110020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002011110030,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "どうして予告にしちゃうんだーって、なりましたよね\r\n本当にひどかったですし",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201111/2002011110030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、俺はそう思ってないけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002011110040,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ふふ……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201111/2002011110040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "監督、答え合わせしなかったろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あの後の撮影、止まらなかったから\r\n灯織と監督の答えが合ってたんだと思うけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺も、灯織の答えが知りたいなと思って……\r\nずっと聞くタイミング逃しててさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002011110050,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "なるほど……",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201111/2002011110050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002011110060,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……そうですね──",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201111/2002011110060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002011110070,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "まずは、なぜ監督が理解と言ったのか、からでしょうか",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201111/2002011110070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、そうだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002011110080,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "私、役のこと理解しなきゃって思っていたんです\r\nたぶん、それ自体は悪いことじゃないんだと思います",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201111/2002011110080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002011110090,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "でも、それだけじゃダメだったんですよね\r\nだからあの時、監督は発破をかけてくださって……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201111/2002011110090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002011110100,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "プロデューサーも、アドバイスをくれました",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201111/2002011110100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……うん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002011110110,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "私はずっと、幽霊を人ではないものと思っていました\r\n人の理解の及ばない、人にはどうにもできない何か",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201111/2002011110110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002011110120,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "今はわかります\r\n私、そこから間違えていたんです",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201111/2002011110120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002011110130,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "幽霊だから、自分とは違うものだから、と──\r\n勉強みたいに、調べただけで理解した気になっていました",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201111/2002011110130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002011110140,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "重ねて、彼女のこと、別の個……他人だからとも\r\n無意識に思っていたんですよね……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201111/2002011110140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002011110150,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "でも、本当はそうじゃなくて",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201111/2002011110150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002011110160,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "俳優さんたちが普通にやっている『演じる』というのは、\r\nそういうことじゃなくて──あの子になること",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201111/2002011110160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002011110170,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "理解の先……憑依が一番しっくりくるでしょうか\r\nこれが、監督の質問に対する答えです",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201111/2002011110170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002011110180,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "はい\r\n合っていたかどうかは……SNSが答えだと思っています",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201111/2002011110180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002011110190,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "でも、私があの子になれた理由……\r\nそれだけじゃありません",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201111/2002011110190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……ん？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002011110200,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "幽霊じゃなくて一個人だと思えるようになった時、\r\n私はあの子に似ているなって思ったんです",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201111/2002011110200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002011110210,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ひとりになって、それが嫌で、怖くて\r\nでも、自分はそこから出られない",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201111/2002011110210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002011110220,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "だから、友達や迷い込んだ人を連れていこうとする",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201111/2002011110220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002011110230,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "一緒にいてほしい、ひとりにしないでほしい\r\nその一心で──",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201111/2002011110230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002011110240,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "やっていることは間違っているんですけど\r\nその気持ち、わかる気がして",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201111/2002011110240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002011110250,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "２８３に入って、真乃とめぐると一緒にいるようになって",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201111/2002011110250"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002011110260,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "プロデューサーに、\r\nプロデュースしてもらうようになって──",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201111/2002011110260"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002011110270,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ずっとひとりでも大丈夫だったのに\r\n今は、どうして平気だったのかわからないんです",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201111/2002011110270"
  },
  {
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2500
  },
  {
    "id": 2002011110280,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "あの子、きっと『未来の私』なんです\r\n私が行きつくかもしれない、未来の姿のひとつ",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201111/2002011110280"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんなこと……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002011110290,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ないって、言い切れないですよね……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201111/2002011110290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002011110300,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ふふふっ\r\n……でも、大丈夫ですよ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201111/2002011110300"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002011110310,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "きっと、そうなるかもしれない未来は、\r\nずっと存在すると思うんですけど",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201111/2002011110310"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002011110320,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "あの子を通して経験したので\r\nあの子に、教わったので",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201111/2002011110320"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002011110330,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "絶対、繰り返しません……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201111/2002011110330"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2500
  },
